  "job_C7.11_20251003_115346": {
    "chunk_text": "uxit israel de medio eorum quoniam. On handa myhtigre & earme \u00fe\u00e6m h\u00e6hstan In manu potenti et brachio excelso quoniam. Se \u00fee tod\u00e6lde s\u00e6 \u00f0a readen on tod\u00e6lednessa Qui diuisit mare rubrum in diuisiones quoniam. & gel\u00e6dde israela folc \u00feurh midlunge hire Et eduxit israel per medium eius quoniam. & he asencte vel & he ofascoc pharao \u00feone cyning & strenc\u00f0e his on s\u00e6 \u00fea readan Et excussit Se \u00fee al\u00e6dde vel se \u00f0e f\u00e6rode folc his \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t westen Qui traduxit populum suum per desertum Se \u00fee ofsloh cyningas micle Qui percussit reges magnos quoniam. & he ofsloh cyningas strange Et occidit reges fortes quoniam. Cyning \u00feone amorreiscan Seon regem amorreorum quoniam. & oh \u00feone cyning on basan et og regem basan quoniam in saeculum. & he sealde eor\u00f0an heora on yrfeweardnesse Et dedit terram eorum hereditatem quoniam. & \u00fea yrfeweardnesse he sealde israele \u00feeowe his Hereditatem israhel seruo suo quoniam. For\u00f0on \u00fee on ea\u00f0modnesse ure gemyndig he w\u00e6s ure Quia in humilitatem nostram memor fuit & he alesde us fram feondum urum Et redemit nos ab inimicis nostris quoniam. Se \u00fee sel\u00f0 mettas \u00e6lcum fl\u00e6sce Qui dat escam omni carni quoniam. Andetta\u00f0 gode heofenes Confitemini deo caeli quoniam. Drihtne drihtenna for\u00f0on \u00fee on ecnesse \u00feurhwuna\u00f0 mildheortnesse his Confitemini domino Ofer flod babiloniscan \u00fe\u00e6r we s\u00e6ton & we weopan \u00fe",
